# Style guide

## Colors (Tailwind utilities from `@theme`)

- `bg-bg` / `text-ink` — page background `#222831`, text `#eee`
- `bg-surface` / `hover:bg-surface-hover` — cards/buttons `#363f4d` / `#434e5f`
- `bg-primary` / `text-primary` — accent `hsl(189 100% 58%)`

## Typography

- Font: Nunito (`font-sans`) via `@nuxt/fonts`
- Headings: `font-extrabold` / `font-black`
- Body: `font-semibold` for UI labels, regular for long copy

## Shape & motion

- Cards: `rounded-3xl` (token `--radius-card`)
- Buttons: `rounded-full` pills
- Primary CTA: soft glow `shadow-[0_0_24px_hsl(189_100%_58%/0.35)]`
- Transitions: `duration-200`
- Focus: primary outline (`*:focus-visible` in main.css)

## Layout

- Mobile-first. Breakpoints: default < sm < md
- Content width: `max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6`
- Nav height: account for `pt-20` / `pt-24` under fixed header

## A11y

- Focus-visible rings required on interactive elements
- Slideshow: `aria-roledescription`, live region, keyboard arrows, pause on hover/focus
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion` (disable autoplay)
- External links: `rel="noopener noreferrer"`
